WEBVTT

00:01.460 --> 00:04.570
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:04.570 --> 00:08.200
Omoi wa kouya o yuku

00:08.200 --> 00:16.130
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

00:21.280 --> 00:27.790
Yaketsuku hizashi no moto kimi wa nani omou?

00:27.790 --> 00:33.730
Urei no hitomi wa ima nani o utsusu?

00:33.730 --> 00:42.670
Mayowazu ni irareru no nara
step by step tayasui darou

00:42.670 --> 00:47.440
Kaze no you ni

00:47.440 --> 00:50.510
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:50.510 --> 00:54.120
Akatsuki no kouya o yuku

00:54.120 --> 01:00.560
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

01:00.560 --> 01:07.360
Don't be afraid kawaru koto wa
osoreru koto ja nai

01:07.360 --> 01:13.470
Kimi ga kimi de aru naraba will be with you

01:13.470 --> 01:20.210
Odayaka na hi o yume-mite

01:20.210 --> 01:27.440
Michi-naki tabiji wa tsuzuku

01:58.450 --> 02:01.380
Hey, I see you're ready.

02:01.380 --> 02:03.450
Are you really sure it's fine, Nadie?

02:03.450 --> 02:05.320
It's fine, it's fine.

02:05.320 --> 02:08.190
See a movie, go shopping...

02:08.190 --> 02:10.660
Take your time and enjoy yourselves.

02:10.660 --> 02:12.690
Thank you.

02:12.690 --> 02:17.130
I'm the one who should be
thanking you, Roberto, Nina.

02:17.130 --> 02:20.660
I'm grateful just for
the fact that you hired us.

02:23.740 --> 02:25.640
See you later!

02:30.410 --> 02:32.510
Nadie.

02:32.510 --> 02:34.180
Oh, Pedro.

02:34.180 --> 02:37.520
- Are they going out?
- Off on a little date in town.

02:40.890 --> 02:44.460
Well, well, quite the antagonistic
stare you've got going there.

02:44.460 --> 02:46.190
She-man.

02:46.190 --> 02:47.530
What was that?

02:47.530 --> 02:49.300
Hey, Joaquin!

02:49.300 --> 02:51.470
Sorry about that, Nadie.

02:51.470 --> 02:56.270
It's no problem. I'm used to
dealing with twisted little kids.

02:56.270 --> 02:57.510
Oh, that reminds me...

02:57.510 --> 03:00.270
Hey, could I ask you to
mind the store for a bit?

03:12.650 --> 03:16.960
If you have any last words, say them now.

03:16.960 --> 03:20.700
A meat pie and some cold lemonade...

03:20.700 --> 03:24.200
Go fix it your damn self.

03:24.200 --> 03:26.500
It's about time you got up and did some work.

03:29.940 --> 03:32.670
Yessir...

03:32.670 --> 03:34.580
- The sky...
- Huh?

03:34.580 --> 03:37.840
- It's so high up there.
- Yeah, it is.

03:41.580 --> 03:43.990
I can't reach it at all.

03:43.990 --> 03:46.350
It'd be scary if you could reach it.

03:52.990 --> 03:55.630
Nadie, is this it?

03:55.630 --> 03:59.570
Oh, that's it. Thank you, Pedro.

03:59.570 --> 04:01.900
- She-man.
- Huh?

04:04.440 --> 04:06.980
You brought it for us?

04:06.980 --> 04:09.000
Thank you, Joaquin.

04:10.780 --> 04:13.310
What's up with this discrimination?

04:13.310 --> 04:14.980
Reminds you of Lirio, doesn't he?

04:14.980 --> 04:17.620
He's nothing like her, though.

04:17.620 --> 04:20.950
- She-man!
- Say that again, and I'll shoot ya.

04:33.700 --> 04:35.870
Hey, Pedro...

04:35.870 --> 04:37.610
Aren't you going to get married again?

04:37.610 --> 04:38.840
What?

04:38.840 --> 04:42.880
It's wonderful that you continue
to care about your late wife,

04:42.880 --> 04:46.980
but don't you think, for Joaquin's sake,
it'd still be better if you had a wife?

04:46.980 --> 04:50.750
Y-Yeah... I guess that's true.

04:50.750 --> 04:52.590
Ellis, why don't you marry him?

04:52.590 --> 04:54.050
What?

04:55.490 --> 04:58.560
Joaquin seems to like you, too, after all.

04:58.560 --> 05:00.660
I'm fine with that if you are, Nadie.

05:00.660 --> 05:02.400
No, hold on a second.

05:02.400 --> 05:04.070
What? You don't want to?

05:04.070 --> 05:06.530
No, that's not what I meant...

05:06.530 --> 05:09.500
If that's what we're talking about, I...

05:14.480 --> 05:17.440
Nadie, the truth is, uh...

05:25.790 --> 05:27.480
Welcome.

05:31.430 --> 05:34.400
Where are you headed? Are you on a trip?

05:47.680 --> 05:49.080
What was that about?

05:49.080 --> 05:51.410
Nadie.

05:51.410 --> 05:54.810
If those guys show up again, give me a call.

05:57.690 --> 05:59.650
Ooh, impressive!

05:59.650 --> 06:01.420
She-man.

06:01.420 --> 06:02.890
Bang!

06:09.960 --> 06:12.000
Thanks for the food.

06:12.000 --> 06:13.740
That was delicious.

06:13.740 --> 06:18.840
Hey, next time, you two should
come have fun with us, too.

06:18.840 --> 06:20.580
They've built an amusement park, you know.

06:20.580 --> 06:23.810
Wow. But you two should go alone.

06:23.810 --> 06:26.450
We'll mind the store.

06:26.450 --> 06:28.980
We want for us to all go, Nadie.

06:28.980 --> 06:31.120
I'm sure it'll be fun.

06:31.120 --> 06:33.650
Ellis, have you ever been
to an amusement park?

06:33.650 --> 06:36.490
- Nope.
- Then you're in for a surprise.

06:36.490 --> 06:39.490
They have a really big Ferris wheel.

06:39.490 --> 06:41.630
How about next Sunday?

06:41.630 --> 06:43.600
Any time is fine with us.

06:43.600 --> 06:46.470
Then it's settled!

06:46.470 --> 06:48.660
Oh, I can't wait!

06:58.880 --> 07:02.020
All going together to the amusement park, huh?

07:02.020 --> 07:04.590
No worries about tomorrow...

07:04.590 --> 07:08.490
Time passing by nice and slowly...

07:08.490 --> 07:11.010
This must be what they call happiness.

07:20.670 --> 07:24.660
How long... has it been since then?

07:34.150 --> 07:36.850
You have the gun out.

07:36.850 --> 07:41.060
Uh, well, I thought maybe it might get rusty...

07:41.060 --> 07:43.850
But you said you wouldn't take it out anymore.

07:48.030 --> 07:49.790
It's lukewarm.

07:52.600 --> 07:55.970
Hey, now, you can't do that either.

07:55.970 --> 07:58.810
We said you couldn't use
your powers, remember?

07:58.810 --> 08:00.710
But no one's watching.

08:00.710 --> 08:02.880
You can't, even if no one's watching.

08:02.880 --> 08:06.810
A bounty hunter and a girl
who has mysterious powers...

08:06.810 --> 08:09.550
If people find out, we won't
be able to live here anymore.

08:09.550 --> 08:10.820
You think so?

08:10.820 --> 08:15.020
If people who didn't know saw that,
they'd think it's dangerous and creepy.

08:15.020 --> 08:17.530
Bounty hunters are creepy?

08:17.530 --> 08:19.230
You know...

08:19.230 --> 08:21.060
Well, whatever.

08:21.060 --> 08:23.100
Let's just be careful.

08:23.100 --> 08:26.170
I won't take out my gun again, either.

08:26.170 --> 08:29.570
So you try to refrain from
using your powers, too.

08:29.570 --> 08:31.170
Yessir.

08:31.170 --> 08:34.980
We've finally secured this idyllic
lifestyle for ourselves, after all.

08:34.980 --> 08:38.280
Farewell, o gun.

08:40.680 --> 08:44.620
Now, then, I think I'll go take a shower, too.

09:11.780 --> 09:14.620
Nadie, are you okay?

09:14.620 --> 09:17.320
Huh? What do you mean?

09:17.320 --> 09:19.850
No, it's nothing.

09:19.850 --> 09:22.250
What is it? You're so weird.

09:28.160 --> 09:31.270
It's "taco, taco, tacos"...

09:31.270 --> 09:34.230
There you are. I've finally found you.

09:35.770 --> 09:38.310
Blue-eyes!

09:38.310 --> 09:40.900
You look like you're doing well.

09:42.310 --> 09:44.880
What?! Branch chief?!

09:44.880 --> 09:48.080
I've been put in charge of this whole area.

09:48.080 --> 09:51.190
A branch chief in just a few months
after joining the company, huh?

09:51.190 --> 09:55.190
I guess this sort of thing really does suit you.

09:55.190 --> 09:56.950
So it would seem.

09:58.890 --> 10:01.700
- There you are.
- Thank you.

10:01.700 --> 10:04.770
Then, I'll be in the store.

10:04.770 --> 10:05.970
Please make yourselves comfortable.

10:05.970 --> 10:08.030
Thank you, Nina.

10:09.740 --> 10:11.040
She's nice.

10:11.040 --> 10:14.200
Yup, she's really nice.

10:15.380 --> 10:17.670
Oh, that reminds me...

10:20.880 --> 10:22.680
A cassette tape?

10:22.680 --> 10:25.210
I was asked to deliver this to you.

10:32.160 --> 10:34.360
- What the heck is this?
- It's Lirio.

10:34.360 --> 10:37.370
Huh? Oh, I see.

10:37.370 --> 10:39.070
But what's she singing?

10:39.070 --> 10:41.070
It's "taco, taco, tacos."

10:41.070 --> 10:44.370
Now that you mention it,
I can sort of hear it, I guess...

10:44.370 --> 10:48.140
Wait, Blue-eyes, so you've seen Lirio?

10:48.140 --> 10:51.750
- Yes, by pure coincidence.
- Really? Was she doing well?

10:51.750 --> 10:55.320
Yes. Ricardo was doing well, too.

10:55.320 --> 10:57.250
Him, I don't really care about.

10:57.250 --> 10:59.920
They've continued to travel, the same as ever.

10:59.920 --> 11:02.120
Travel?

11:02.120 --> 11:04.830
Really...

11:04.830 --> 11:09.820
And Ricardo's teaching Lirio
how to use a boomerang.

11:11.370 --> 11:14.170
All right, it's looking good.

11:14.170 --> 11:15.830
Here it comes.

11:21.410 --> 11:25.050
You have to keep your eyes on it.

11:25.050 --> 11:27.210
Wow...

11:27.210 --> 11:30.080
It seems she was adamant that he teach her.

11:30.080 --> 11:33.790
I guess Lirio wants to help
Ricardo in her own way.

11:33.790 --> 11:36.020
A lot of things happened, after all.

11:36.020 --> 11:37.730
I see...

11:37.730 --> 11:39.790
Nadie.

11:39.790 --> 11:41.400
What is it?

11:41.400 --> 11:44.420
Do you want to travel again?

11:47.400 --> 11:50.040
Oh, you little... What a thing to suggest!

11:50.040 --> 11:52.010
Don't be ridiculous.

11:52.010 --> 11:54.040
All the troublesome stuff is finally behind us

11:54.040 --> 11:57.310
and we get to live in this wonderful place now.

11:57.310 --> 11:58.710
Really?

11:58.710 --> 12:01.850
I've had enough of life on the road,
with no place to call home.

12:01.850 --> 12:03.750
This place is the best.

12:03.750 --> 12:05.220
You don't agree with that, Ellis?

12:05.220 --> 12:08.790
No, I love it here, too.

12:08.790 --> 12:12.730
Right? So don't say weird things like that.

12:14.760 --> 12:16.420
Yes? Come in.

12:19.230 --> 12:20.930
It can't be...

12:33.450 --> 12:36.120
- Rosenberg!
- Huh?

12:36.120 --> 12:38.190
- What?
- Nope.

12:38.190 --> 12:39.920
Let me introduce you.

12:39.920 --> 12:41.990
He's my subordinate.

12:41.990 --> 12:45.930
I'm Steve Beckman. Pleased to meet you.

12:45.930 --> 12:48.800
- Right...
- Did you finish distributing the fliers?

12:48.800 --> 12:50.100
Yes, Chief.

12:50.100 --> 12:51.830
I covered all the main areas around here.

12:51.830 --> 12:56.070
I see. Then, wait in the car for me.
I'll be right there.

12:56.070 --> 12:59.940
Yes, ma'am. Please excuse me.

12:59.940 --> 13:01.980
Wow, they look alike.

13:01.980 --> 13:03.480
He's a good, honest kid.

13:03.480 --> 13:06.550
- You're twisted.
- It just turned out this way.

13:06.550 --> 13:11.090
Are you sure you didn't actually
have a crush on Rosenberg?

13:11.090 --> 13:14.050
- Just kidding.
- Maybe I did.

13:14.050 --> 13:17.390
- What?!
- I'm joking.

13:17.390 --> 13:20.020
I'll kill you three times over later!

13:22.500 --> 13:24.100
Uh, um...

13:24.100 --> 13:27.100
What's wrong? Go wait outside.

13:27.100 --> 13:29.400
Th-The thing is...

13:32.310 --> 13:34.470
Shut up and come with me.

13:40.280 --> 13:42.580
There you are.

13:42.580 --> 13:44.390
- Nadie!
- Ellis!

13:44.390 --> 13:47.250
- Are we the ones you're after?
- Yeah, you are.

13:47.250 --> 13:50.360
Then the other people have
nothing to do with this, right?

13:50.360 --> 13:51.990
Let them go.

13:51.990 --> 13:55.030
- We can't do that.
- Why not?

13:55.030 --> 13:59.200
Because if we take you for fools like
last time, we'll end up paying for it.

13:59.200 --> 14:00.860
Last time?

14:05.340 --> 14:09.110
- Who are you?
- They're the transvestite people.

14:09.110 --> 14:10.980
That's right! It's us!

14:10.980 --> 14:13.010
This is all your fault!

14:13.010 --> 14:15.420
You better remember us properly!

14:15.420 --> 14:18.010
If you have any last words, say them now.

14:25.030 --> 14:27.460
We were hospitalized due to serious injuries...

14:27.460 --> 14:33.000
And we wanted to heal up as quickly
as possible to chase after you two...

14:33.000 --> 14:36.300
So we took in all the nutrients we could
and this is how we ended up!

14:36.300 --> 14:39.140
- Got a problem with that?!
- Good for you!

14:40.470 --> 14:43.610
Oh, yes, yes. Sorry about that.

14:43.610 --> 14:46.010
Your head is ours for sure this time!

14:46.010 --> 14:48.350
And with the bounty, we'll go on a medical diet!

14:48.350 --> 14:50.420
I see, with the bounty, huh?

14:50.420 --> 14:52.890
Why don't you tell them
the reality of the matter?

14:52.890 --> 14:54.920
Good idea. Ellis.

14:54.920 --> 14:57.890
I'm not a bounty anymore.

14:57.890 --> 14:59.030
What?

14:59.030 --> 15:02.930
She's long since been taken off the wanted list.

15:02.930 --> 15:04.660
You didn't know?

15:07.430 --> 15:09.900
Talk about oblivious.

15:09.900 --> 15:12.210
So, there you go. Case closed.

15:12.210 --> 15:14.280
- Not yet!
- Pardon?

15:14.280 --> 15:15.510
That's right!

15:15.510 --> 15:21.650
After we've gained all this weight,
there's no way we can just back down!

15:21.650 --> 15:24.620
We're ordinary citizens now.

15:24.620 --> 15:26.990
Do you want to become plain old murderers?

15:26.990 --> 15:28.450
Silence!

15:30.660 --> 15:32.590
Calm down.

15:32.590 --> 15:35.930
Ch-Chief, this is dangerous.

15:35.930 --> 15:37.970
If you let your emotions get the better of you,

15:37.970 --> 15:40.300
you'll wind up regretting it later.

15:40.300 --> 15:42.340
Nobody asked you!

15:42.340 --> 15:45.170
Don't lecture us like you're so high and mighty!

15:45.170 --> 15:48.040
Keep your nose out of this, you old lady!

15:48.040 --> 15:49.980
Old lady?

15:53.680 --> 15:56.220
Wh-What?!

15:56.220 --> 15:58.250
Freeze!

15:58.250 --> 16:01.190
No subordinate of mine had better utter a peep.

16:05.190 --> 16:07.090
Now, shoot me.

16:07.090 --> 16:08.560
Achoo!

16:10.430 --> 16:12.090
Why, you!

16:20.310 --> 16:23.010
Chief!

16:23.010 --> 16:26.480
Give it up quietly.

16:26.480 --> 16:29.280
We're not going to be done in by the likes of...

16:32.090 --> 16:34.690
The end.

16:34.690 --> 16:37.250
Ow, that hurt...

16:47.400 --> 16:50.000
Owowowow...

16:50.000 --> 16:52.370
Honestly, talk about brute force...

16:52.370 --> 16:54.600
Nadie, are you all right?!

16:58.180 --> 17:01.580
- Ellis!
- Don't move!

17:01.580 --> 17:03.480
Drop your gun.

17:07.320 --> 17:09.080
Quickly!

17:13.590 --> 17:15.390
Let go!

17:20.200 --> 17:22.440
Chief!

17:22.440 --> 17:24.730
I'll turn you into Swiss cheese!

17:26.140 --> 17:28.480
Joaquin!

17:28.480 --> 17:31.170
- Brat!
- No!

17:34.720 --> 17:36.440
H-Hot!

17:49.630 --> 17:52.790
If you have any last words, say them now.

18:02.480 --> 18:05.070
So you were a bounty hunter.

18:07.350 --> 18:08.810
Yeah.

18:11.690 --> 18:14.490
- I'm a witch.
- What?

18:14.490 --> 18:17.790
Well, I think a full explanation about her

18:17.790 --> 18:21.660
would actually be more confusing,
so please don't ask.

18:21.660 --> 18:24.570
At any rate, thank you
for everything until today.

18:24.570 --> 18:26.800
I don't know how to express my appreciation.

18:26.800 --> 18:29.740
- Don't go.
- What?

18:29.740 --> 18:32.410
We talked it over.

18:32.410 --> 18:34.540
We decided we'd pretend
that we didn't see anything.

18:34.540 --> 18:37.710
That we didn't hear anything.

18:37.710 --> 18:41.320
You've had to go through this
before, too, haven't you?

18:41.320 --> 18:42.780
Do you plan to go to yet another town

18:42.780 --> 18:45.420
and make a life hiding your identities again?

18:45.420 --> 18:47.410
That will be hard on you.

18:49.460 --> 18:53.590
Stay here, Nadie, Ellis.

18:53.590 --> 18:55.700
We want you to stay.

18:55.700 --> 18:59.470
If you don't want to live with us,
we'll find a house for you.

18:59.470 --> 19:02.300
We'll come up with the money for it somehow.

19:02.300 --> 19:05.540
We'll be fine as long as you
pay us back eventually. Okay?

19:05.540 --> 19:08.580
Yeah, that's right.

19:08.580 --> 19:10.370
So...

19:22.720 --> 19:24.550
Thank you.

19:27.490 --> 19:29.160
Nadie...

19:30.500 --> 19:33.770
Then, you'll stay?

19:33.770 --> 19:38.430
Did you hear that? Isn't this great, Ellis?

19:40.810 --> 19:44.680
Thank you. It really warms my heart.

19:44.680 --> 19:47.480
But... we're going.

19:47.480 --> 19:49.550
What?

19:49.550 --> 19:52.850
- Ellis?
- Why?

19:52.850 --> 19:54.720
Why?

20:02.800 --> 20:06.400
When you have that sparkle in
your eyes, that's the Nadie...

20:06.400 --> 20:08.330
...that I love.

20:10.740 --> 20:12.710
Ellis...

20:18.550 --> 20:20.780
I see...

20:20.780 --> 20:22.610
I have to agree.

20:27.720 --> 20:29.690
Let's go, Nadie.

20:29.690 --> 20:32.390
Ellis...

20:32.390 --> 20:34.380
Let's set out on a journey.

20:41.940 --> 20:44.530
All right, let's go.

22:06.020 --> 22:10.520
Now, then, where shall we go, partner?

22:10.520 --> 22:13.660
Let's go see Lirio.

22:13.660 --> 22:15.320
Ooh!

22:23.000 --> 22:24.870
- Yessir!
- Yessir!

22:26.510 --> 22:30.480
And the uncharted journey...

22:30.480 --> 22:32.840
...continues...

22:36.520 --> 22:40.350
Owaranai natsu no you ni

22:40.350 --> 22:43.790
Chiranai hana no you ni

22:43.790 --> 22:47.690
Dakishimeta sono ude o

22:47.690 --> 22:55.830
Zutto hanasanaide ite yo

23:02.040 --> 23:05.610
Sugari-tsuite-mitemo

23:05.610 --> 23:11.420
Mune wa mada chigau hakanasa de

23:11.420 --> 23:15.390
Toki no rizumu kazoeteru

23:15.390 --> 23:19.530
Akai hoshi no yoru

23:19.530 --> 23:23.530
Kiete-yuku nukumori

23:23.530 --> 23:27.470
Tsunagi-tometai no yo

23:27.470 --> 23:33.870
Hitomi tojita kimi o

23:33.870 --> 23:37.840
Akogare o kuri-kaeshi

23:37.840 --> 23:41.180
Doko e mo yukenaku-temo

23:41.180 --> 23:45.190
Setsunasa no tachidomaru

23:45.190 --> 23:51.690
Kono hito-toki ga futari no

23:51.690 --> 23:56.690
Subete yo
